cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use datanuggets-flow, please cite the article that introduced data
  nuggets, given below.
title: datanuggets-flow
abstract: >-
  A flow cytometry pipeline built on the datanuggets library. It gates each
  FCS file on two channels, forward and side scatter unless others are named,
  reduces the populations you keep to weighted data nuggets and clusters the
  nuggets of every file together.
type: software
